{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR Exploratory Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody beings from vast cosmos to tiny plankton, and even your mind! Use your hands to flap or swim to navigate unfamiliar worlds through the eyes of other beings. Power, identity, and scale become fluid. Faced with the vastness of the world, human is only a drop in the ocean, part of a continuum of life far greater than us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/00ff18df3a75d76a6879477dd06206a2.poster.avif?t=1758738950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/00ff18df3a75d76a6879477dd06206a2.webm?t=1758738950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/00ff18df3a75d76a6879477dd06206a2.mp4?t=1758738950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/ffe8b8696d7ead3946dfbadfece7b3be.poster.avif?t=1758738950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/ffe8b8696d7ead3946dfbadfece7b3be.webm?t=1758738950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/ffe8b8696d7ead3946dfbadfece7b3be.mp4?t=1758738950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gestural Interactions</strong>\u200b\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your body to experience life as different non-human beings!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic power: Grab and throw the planets around, or spread your arms to alter the flow of comets and stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sky: Rain to grow trees and  bully play with the animals!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butterfly: Flap your arms to fly through the sunlit garden</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plankton: Drift as a glowing plankton to illuminate the ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subconscious: Submerge within and swim through your subconscious space</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/2c9562045a776424b744fdd7f79658dc.poster.avif?t=1758738950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/2c9562045a776424b744fdd7f79658dc.webm?t=1758738950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/2c9562045a776424b744fdd7f79658dc.mp4?t=1758738950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/87b8ea83967a8bba7a6cce6da663af32.poster.avif?t=1758738950\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/87b8ea83967a8bba7a6cce6da663af32.webm?t=1758738950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/87b8ea83967a8bba7a6cce6da663af32.mp4?t=1758738950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050070/extras/82bc89